You're doing it the way we intended. The surprising thing is "it then fails to find the source of the package upon restore". When you're restoring, is there anything in ./packrat.sources/<packagename>? That's where packrat is supposed to go looking for it first, and we expect you to check the whole packrat.sources directory into source control.

